151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Adoption of AI and Cloud Computing in Fintech Is Driving Strong Market Expansion The global fintech market was valued at USD 340.10 billion in 2024 and is projected to grow to USD 1,126.64 billion by 2032. This growth is fueled by the use of AI and machine learning, helping fintech firms improve fraud detection, customer service, credit scoring, and personalization. Cloud computing adds to this by giving them scalable, low-cost infrastructure to quickly build and roll out new solutions.)
/E (Adoption of AI and Cloud Computing in Fintech Is Driving Strong Market Expansion The global fintech market was valued at USD 340.10 billion in 2024 and is projected to grow to USD 1,126.64 billion by 2032. This growth is fueled by the use of AI and machine learning, helping fintech firms improve fraud detection, customer service, credit scoring, and personalization. Cloud computing adds to this by giving them scalable, low-cost infrastructure to quickly build and roll out new solutions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
