152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Security Risks and Data Privacy Concerns Are Key Constraints on Fintech Expansion Fintech firms face rising cybersecurity risks, with the global average cost of a data breach at 4.44 million dollars in 2025, down from 4.88 million in 2024 but still one of the highest among industries. In the United States, breach costs climbed to a record 10.22 million dollars in 2025, while in India the average cost rose to about 2.7 million dollars, up 13 percent from the previous year. These figures show that despite some global improvements, regional vulnerabilities and third-party exposures continue to impose heavy financial pressures on fintech companies)
/E (Security Risks and Data Privacy Concerns Are Key Constraints on Fintech Expansion Fintech firms face rising cybersecurity risks, with the global average cost of a data breach at 4.44 million dollars in 2025, down from 4.88 million in 2024 but still one of the highest among industries. In the United States, breach costs climbed to a record 10.22 million dollars in 2025, while in India the average cost rose to about 2.7 million dollars, up 13 percent from the previous year. These figures show that despite some global improvements, regional vulnerabilities and third-party exposures continue to impose heavy financial pressures on fintech companies)
