268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Wise Plc has delivered strong improvement in performance over the last five years. ROE increased from 15.7% in FY21 to a peak of 61.5% in FY24, before normalizing to 42.5% in FY25. ROCE followed a similar trend, rising from 20.4% to 81.5% and later settling at 48.3%. These results highlight efficient resource utilization, improved productivity, and a solid foundation for sustained value creation.This shows that Wise PLC is strong and ready to grow even more in the future.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
