280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Wise operates in a cross-border payments market of over USD 850 billion in personal remittances and USD 20 trillion in wider transactions. The company serves more than 11 million active customers and processes around 150 billion  GBP annually, giving it a strong position among digital-first providers. With an average fee of 0.6 percent compared to the global average of 6.2 percent, Wise delivers significant cost savings and achieves high customer satisfaction. As digital remittances grow at a 15 - 17 percent CAGR through 2030, Wise is well placed to gain market share.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Scalable and Cost-Efficient Model)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Wise relies on local liquidity pools instead of SWIFT, enabling about 60 percent of transfers to arrive instantly and over 90 percent within 24 hours. The system minimizes infrastructure costs while improving speed and reliability, giving Wise a structural cost edge. With two-thirds of customers acquired through referrals, growing volumes quickly translate into higher operating margins.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Favorable Industry Tailwinds)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The rise of digital payments, e-commerce globalization, cross-border SME trade and remote work trends are accelerating demand for seamless multi-currency solutions. Traditional banks face regulatory and operational constraints that prevent them from competing effectively on cost or speed, providing Wise with a structural advantage. The addressable market continues to expand rapidly, supporting 15 to 20 percent annualized growth prospects. In addition, increasing adoption of online marketplaces, growth in freelancer and gig-economy payments and rising cross-border capital flows further strengthen demand for low-cost, real-time money transfer platforms. With its established brand, global liquidity network and proven technology stack, Wise is well placed to capture a disproportionate share of this expanding opportunity set, translating favorable industry tailwinds into sustained revenue and margin growth.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
