430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We propose a reset of the shareholder framework alongside a leveraged buyout, acquiring a 75 percent controlling stake. All shares will be harmonised into a single ordinary class, eliminating the dual-class imbalance and aligning ownership with control. With majority authority, we can provide clear strategic direction and disciplined capital allocation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
