434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Select institutional investors will retain a 10 percent position, ensuring continuity and external validation. We will also remove the public float and take Wise private, freeing the company from quarterly reporting cycles and market-driven pressures, allowing full focus on long-term value creation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [16]
>>
